@yuuu0109/dsh-cache-hit-decimal README · dsh-cache-hit-decimal：A small DeepSeek Harness Web plugin that replaces the native integer cache-hit percentage with a two-decimal value, such as `42.86%`.

It shadows the existing `stats` cell in `conversation.composer.dock` instead of patching the official conversation package. Removing the plugin restores the native integer display.

[中文说明](README.zh.md)

